@startuml
actor "클라이언트 (사용자)" as client
participant "콘텐츠 컨트롤러" as controller
participant "콘텐츠 서비스" as service
participant "보안 컨텍스트" as security
database "H2 데이터베이스" as db

client -> controller : PUT /api/contents/{id}
activate controller

controller -> service : 업데이트(id, 제목, 설명)
activate service

service -> db : findById(id)
db --> service : 콘텐츠 엔티티

service -> security : getAuthentication()
security --> service : 현재 사용자 (이름, 역할)

service -> service : 권한 확인(contents)
note right
  - 관리자 여부?
  - OR 작성자가 현재 사용자와 동일한가?
end note

alt 권한 없음
    service --> controller : AccessDeniedException 발생
    controller --> client : 403 금지됨
else 권한 있음
    service -> contents : 제목, 설명 업데이트
    service -> db : save(contents)
    service --> controller : 성공
    controller --> client : 200 OK
end

deactivate service
deactivate controller
@enduml
